<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Incident at Le Perouse Strait, 2014</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;Japan&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt; vs. &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Russia&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;Date/Time: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;20th August, 2014 / 08:00:00 Zulu&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;Location: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;Le &lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:PlaceName w:st="on"&gt;Perouse&lt;/st1:PlaceName&gt; &lt;st1:PlaceType w:st="on"&gt;Strait&lt;/st1:PlaceType&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;Playable Sides: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;Japan&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;The islands in North of Japan have been always a matter of conflict between &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Russia&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; and &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Japan&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;Pacific Russian Fleet is deployed in the near of Le Perouse Strait in a exercise which is close monitored by Japanese submarines.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;This kind of situations could develop in serious incidents, this scenario depicts one of these that can led to a military action.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;This scenario is a excuse to see in action the new Japanese ‘Carrier’ Destroyers with a complement of F-35 against new Russian units.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;Authors: David Perez ‘Iosef’ and Miguel Molina ‘Meroka37’ (Members of Command PdL Design Team&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
  <Complexity>1</Complexity>
  <Difficulty>4</Difficulty>
